</header>

<div class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow mono">Cornell University · Registered Student Organization</div>
    <h1>Cornell Credit Investment Club</h1>
    <p class="lede">Cornell's first credit investment organization, dedicated to teaching students the fundamentals of credit investing across private and public markets. We prepare members for recruiting and careers in credit through real case work and direct industry conversations.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow mono">Our Mission</div>
      <h2>What we're building, and why it matters</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="pull">To give every Cornell student, regardless of background, a real foundation in credit investing — from private credit and direct lending to public credit and secondaries.</p>
        <p>We pair technical training with real presentation and case-pitch experience, and connect members directly with practitioners and firms across the industry, so they're ready for recruiting and internships in credit from day one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-list">
        <div class="stat-row"><div class="k">Founded</div><div class="v mono">2026</div></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><div class="k">Executive board</div><div class="v mono">5</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow mono">What We Do</div>
      <h2>How we train our members</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="process">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n mono">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>New Member Education</h3>
          <p>A 10-week curriculum that builds the foundation of a credit investor from the ground up — the different forms credit investing takes, how to build a downside model, how to evaluate a business through a credit lens, and how to read the risk spectrum across debt tranches. By the end, members are equipped to source, underwrite, and defend a credit pitch on their own.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n mono">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Professional Development</h3>
          <p>Once the fundamentals are in place, we turn to the recruiting process itself — resume and cover letter reviews, mock interviews built around real credit case questions, and direct guidance on networking, so members walk into internship and full-time recruiting prepared and confident.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="team">
  <div class="wrap">
